{"h":3390,"w":2400,"lines":[{"t":"@MirsIELTS","h":0.034883720825555353,"y":0.0058139535281626076,"w":0.30595481872558594,"c":1,"x":0.0061601675395455873},{"h":0.015268007351585511,"x":0.088064139341945805,"y":0.046629830348917101,"w":0.12163578033447266,"c":1,"t":"Audioscripts"},{"w":0.71675918579101561,"t":"competitive and that's not what you want when you're just starting. I don't think the time of","x":0.088230237870005793,"h":0.017653272285573895,"c":1,"y":0.092584001646115466},{"h":0.017643372077154162,"t":"day is especially important - some people are better in the evening, while others are morning","x":0.090246448494101988,"y":0.10692240915318996,"w":0.73942123413085936,"c":1},{"y":0.12438217762151382,"c":1,"t":"people - but you need to be consistent, so aim to train regularly - twice a week is enough to","x":0.088234193416567644,"w":0.73318735758463538,"h":0.016376652900448208},{"x":0.088171000905368946,"h":0.013973638934020149,"w":0.090598449707031264,"c":1,"y":0.13908876191225028,"t":"begin with."},{"h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1,"x":0.85831622044259348,"t":"Q13\/14","y":0.12645348865123751,"w":0.061601645151774131},{"t":"New members often say to me that they've been put off running either because they lack","y":0.18274794215219714,"w":0.6962873331705729,"c":1,"x":0.090249331013862857,"h":0.016580034779236419},{"h":0.018363915502497608,"y":0.19843445539470894,"x":0.088208922823932598,"w":0.74349288940429692,"c":1,"t":"confidence, or they don't have time, or they think they dislike running. Ceri, for example, joined"},{"y":0.21417660077759659,"h":0.017495881139704683,"c":1,"x":0.088202331209387044,"w":0.71475865681966144,"t":"the club two years ago at the age of 40. She'd always enjoyed running at school but wasn't"},{"h":0.017969553449512676,"x":0.088182251483430896,"w":0.72302480061848962,"t":"sure if she'd be able to do it. She was worried about being left behind and being the slowest","y":0.22913963922904723,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"runner. But she says she was made to feel so welcome she soon forgot all about that.","y":0.24515768066918175,"x":0.090277404380295065,"w":0.6736651611328125,"h":0.015529229718323712},{"w":0.74140218098958333,"x":0.086187235847033222,"t":"James had always hated the idea of running but a friend encouraged him to come along for a","h":0.016715011484151776,"c":1,"y":0.26832106585505711},{"h":0.016892173789595399,"y":0.28337716648242406,"x":0.088203026806344273,"c":1,"w":0.73530390421549474,"t":"taster session and he hasn't looked back. He never misses a training session despite having"},{"y":0.30087209284550553,"x":0.090349075528308023,"c":1,"t":"a really demanding job.","w":0.18891170501708987,"h":0.011627907316944963},{"h":0.017406385978766203,"x":0.088211431754904382,"c":1,"t":"Leo was worried about having to commit himself to training sessions every week and wasn't","y":0.32203631262421883,"w":0.72912048339843749},{"w":0.74554758707682289,"c":1,"h":0.01833161660703575,"x":0.086168904334940635,"y":0.33689919888082009,"t":"sure he'd be able to fit training into his busy schedule. But after experiencing a lot of stress at"},{"w":0.73716634114583335,"c":1,"t":"work he came along to us and gave it a go. Now he says he feels much more relaxed and he","y":0.35457227134394675,"x":0.088295679376889397,"h":0.014749262536873253},{"c":1,"w":0.25504056294759114,"h":0.014050216449748798,"y":0.36868225921641551,"x":0.088085827341192177,"t":"looks forward to his weekly run."},{"y":0.39198637284787563,"x":0.088224212479864922,"w":0.69008310953776042,"h":0.016551334527389772,"c":1,"t":"Mark is quite typical of our new members. He's never considered himself to be a sporty"},{"x":0.08616606534957176,"t":"person and it was only when he retired that he decided to take up the challenge of trying","w":0.70245117187500006,"h":0.017977056812747749,"y":0.40660348491706966,"c":1},{"x":0.086127810874558855,"w":0.71069310506184891,"h":0.017578084489940471,"y":0.42261710660030505,"t":"to run 5 kilometres. It took him months to find the courage to contact us but felt reassured","c":1},{"x":0.086186783641246614,"w":0.73111521402994784,"h":0.016695921681271875,"c":1,"y":0.43881008468947102,"t":"immediately as there were other people his age who were only just taking up running for the"},{"y":0.45307236081956725,"x":0.087630109385307783,"w":0.077377319335937514,"c":1,"t":"first time.","h":0.014514861205334517},{"t":"My own journey hasn't been easy. I did my first marathon when I was 37, after having had","w":0.71265202840169273,"x":0.086174481229434718,"y":0.47670681895966638,"h":0.017853223750021519,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.49193554841198484,"w":0.7044985961914062,"t":"two kids. My husband had been running marathons for years, but I never dreamed I'd be","x":0.086140874704630235,"h":0.018285630375234785},{"y":0.50680005108224535,"w":0.71072123209635418,"t":"doing one with him. I managed to complete it in four hours, but I felt like giving up halfway","x":0.086121180630458788,"h":0.01914915911919246,"c":1},{"t":"through - it was only the support of the spectators that kept me going.","w":0.55872970581054682,"x":0.086139014719591428,"h":0.016620944312891739,"y":0.52284548199926761,"c":1},{"t":"I do think signing up for a race of whatever length is motivating - whether it's 5K or","x":0.084104631036418923,"w":0.66133895874023441,"h":0.017461182585859714,"c":1,"y":0.54595363201521829},{"c":1,"t":"25K - because it's good to have something to work towards and it gives you a sense of","y":0.5609100445288181,"w":0.696277821858724,"x":0.086133593430911426,"h":0.01824464713577667},{"t":"achievement. I did my first 10K after only six months, which was certainly very challenging","x":0.086147524451730531,"c":1,"w":0.71478200276692705,"h":0.017953728644897082,"y":0.57667161610544193},{"t":"and not something I'd necessarily recommend. But after you've been training for a few","h":0.017065402680793706,"c":1,"w":0.68393198649088549,"y":0.59221223123124944,"x":0.086171728964594074},{"c":1,"t":"weeks, it's worth putting your name down for a 5K - some people find they only need a few","x":0.084107094018391518,"y":0.60707893323209416,"w":0.72502014160156247,"h":0.018454430729238691},{"t":"practice runs before taking part in a race, but I'd give yourself a couple of months at least.","w":0.71065999348958331,"h":0.017979698406208167,"c":1,"y":0.62308888536396734,"x":0.08614992295703805},{"t":"Well, I hope that's given ...","c":1,"x":0.08418890600094954,"y":0.64680232568704488,"w":0.22587270100911461,"h":0.016029532891107534},{"y":0.21802325607402095,"t":"Q15","c":1,"x":0.85626283323008845,"w":0.039014374415079711,"h":0.013081394746943587},{"t":"Q16","h":0.011627907316944963,"c":1,"w":0.039014374415079711,"y":0.27325581374918828,"x":0.85626283322367158},{"w":0.036960986455281564,"t":"Q17","y":0.3270348839834023,"h":0.013081394746943587,"x":0.85626283316443541,"c":1},{"h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1,"y":0.42296511653913726,"w":0.036960986455281564,"t":"Q18","x":0.85626283315839624},{"w":0.039014371236165357,"c":1,"h":0.013081394746943587,"x":0.85420944700512069,"t":"Q19","y":0.51308139548626652},{"x":0.85420944512690578,"w":0.039014374415079711,"y":0.59593023281820701,"h":0.013081394746943587,"t":"Q20","c":1},{"w":0.1047227923075358,"c":1,"x":0.086242299390379931,"y":0.70348837205090131,"t":"PART 3","h":0.015988371857499684},{"t":"KIERAN:","h":0.010728047238690253,"x":0.086147035889270501,"y":0.73373481355578152,"w":0.057685394287109365,"c":1},{"y":0.7484070272222717,"w":0.043288577397664396,"c":1,"t":"JANE:","x":0.084105198178316076,"h":0.013360363895562499},{"h":0.010174418761666915,"t":"KIERAN:","x":0.086242298344896773,"y":0.78052325571509684,"w":0.057494869232177725,"c":1},{"w":0.043606157302856441,"y":0.79464692824145111,"t":"JANE:","c":1,"x":0.083946408328841621,"h":0.013903817595985468},{"c":1,"w":0.057494862874348948,"t":"KIERAN:","x":0.086242302084386088,"y":0.81104651142221884,"h":0.010174418761666804},{"t":"JANE:","c":1,"y":0.82693292870528268,"x":0.082083548112792906,"w":0.04527848879496256,"h":0.011831816951785479},{"y":0.85689227774329302,"w":0.058003851572672516,"c":1,"x":0.083934419081287598,"t":"KIERAN:","h":0.01295963051044835},{"y":0.87209302350300433,"t":"JANE:","x":0.082135523768573929,"c":1,"h":0.011627906191665538,"w":0.045174538294474278},{"t":"So Jane - you'll be off to Denmark soon to do your work placement.","x":0.18266581528232714,"y":0.73251852943681217,"w":0.5381558736165365,"h":0.016576301664729454,"c":1},{"y":0.74720992164997624,"c":1,"t":"Yes, I'm really looking forward to it and l've just started packing up all my books","x":0.18264904021956541,"w":0.63058939615885412,"h":0.018018784424548295},{"y":0.76338928572317932,"x":0.18244409535070905,"h":0.014338760038392739,"t":"to put in storage.","c":1,"w":0.13821997324625651},{"x":0.18256448725202781,"y":0.77870657625743234,"c":1,"t":"Well, I hope they don't get spoilt.","w":0.25907801310221357,"h":0.016889011754398831},{"w":0.63860371907552083,"h":0.016061260707258884,"c":1,"t":"It's OK - my grandfather works in a bookshop and he told me how to pack them.","y":0.79498525079876547,"x":0.1827515283880001},{"c":1,"x":0.18275153761783686,"y":0.80959302330090144,"w":0.14373716990152996,"h":0.016070693362075672,"t":"Oh, that's helpful."},{"t":"He says you have to support the spine otherwise the paper can come away from","x":0.18267381272073446,"y":0.82554643197624789,"w":0.64490473429361983,"h":0.017616643314867897,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.18028007253429129,"h":0.017400218322213834,"w":0.18151908874511719,"t":"Yeah - that's obvious.","y":0.85487948519964907},{"y":0.87076343027098779,"w":0.62030029296875,"c":1,"h":0.017350554114597738,"t":"He also told me to pack them flat in the box not on their side - again because","x":0.18061830698518994},{"w":0.64887064615885426,"h":0.016048398200741221,"t":"they can bend and if you leave them like that for, say, a year, it's quite hard to get","c":1,"x":0.17864475894415838,"y":0.88808139546382325},{"y":0.90131396945787279,"h":0.017440567466713297,"x":0.18041989127935892,"w":0.26752504984537762,"t":"them back to their normal shape.","c":1},{"y":0.92005813979735585,"w":0.039014374415079753,"h":0.013081394746943587,"x":0.084188911252419063,"c":1,"t":"116"},{"w":0.45655776977539064,"h":0.05293413010318726,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","x":0.51778967650898156,"y":0.93523094402038687,"c":1}]}